// int against decimal, bigint and float, text under the default collation (case and trailing blanks) and a CS one,
// dates against a text and a datetime, variables, empty input, 3,000 rows (NULLs, duplicates) grouped and joined,
// errors in a later row (8134, 245) and the syntax errors (102, 156 in a select list, 4145 for a row). Each batch
// runs against lexdb with SET lexdb_batch = off and on: "same: " and the answer, or DIFFERENT and both.
